{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55510","headline":"题石门 · 罗隐","name":"题石门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵岩一窍何年凿？混沌初开有此门。\n探药仙人何处去，山中不改旧乾坤。\n（《宛陵郡志备要》。\n此首从《郑州大学学报》一九八六年六期李之亮《〈罗隐年谱〉补正》一文所辑收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}